+# =====================================================
+# PDQ parser mappings  (Phase 2 / BE-01 — VTF-331)
+# Machine-readable step divisors + INTERVAL enum for the CQ-IR parser.
+#
+# Kept SEPARATE from value-mappings.properties on purpose: that file is
+# display-only (raw -> human label, forward direction) and is consumed by
+# ValueMappingService for report rendering. The PDQ parser needs the opposite
+# (numeric transforms + reverse INTERVAL lookup), so mixing them would force a
+# key collision on '<field>.step' and blur the display-vs-raw separation.
+# See fcvt-phase2-design.md §6.3. AE may tune these without a rebuild.
+# =====================================================
+
+# --- Per-field step divisor: PDQ value (ms / s) / step = ADC stored value ---
+step.OCC_EXT=100
+step.OCC_DELAY=100
+step.RESET_OP_TIME=10
+step.RESET_LD_TIME=100
+step.SWITCH_GE=100
+step.SWITCH_GSF=100
+step.PRERESET_ACT_TIME=10
+step.RESET_DELAY=1
+step.IP_SWITCH_TIME=1
+step.TIMEOUT_VALUE=10
+
